{"id":"d8196ceb5f6e3532","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-cor-wellorder.md","title":"Well-Ordering Corollary","display":"cor-wellorder — Well-Ordering Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-wellorder","aliases":["58-cor-wellorder","58-cor-wellordering-theorem","Well-Ordering Theorem"],"display":"cor-wellorder — Well-Ordering Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-wellorder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-wellorder</span><span>58-cor-wellordering-theorem</span><span>Well-Ordering Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-wellorder — Well-Ordering Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md\">../batch01/58-ax-ac.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"296e574c4ef84f16\" href=\"?note=296e574c4ef84f16\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md\">../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"296e574c4ef84f16\" href=\"?note=296e574c4ef84f16\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md\">../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}wellorder} \\vdash \\forall X\\in V\\;\\exists R\\in V\\;\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}wellorder} \\vdash \\forall X\\in V\\;\\exists R\\in V\\;\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The axiom of choice implies every set can be well-ordered.</li>\n<li>Every set has a cardinality, which is an initial ordinal.</li>\n<li><code>58-cor-wellordering-theorem</code> is merged here; it asserted the same AC-implies-well-ordering statement.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md","status":"resolved","id":"296e574c4ef84f16","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md","status":"resolved","id":"296e574c4ef84f16","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}wellorder} \\vdash \\forall X\\in V\\;\\exists R\\in V\\;\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X)","display":true}],"bytes":857,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-cor-wellorder.md|58-cor-wellorder]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["65d9a1e690c32aad","b3dac4cf78c440c7","296e574c4ef84f16"]}